 "notes": "Same compartment as 18a: ringed U with brick-pattern bars, stubbed rings, a bowtie-and-foot stem, two ring pairs flanking the posts; a long rail from the box to the right; a flagged, tapered '1' stroke crossing the rail down to a ring-and-band at the U's foot; two rings and a small ringed curl on the rail; a '3'-shaped double lobe with a wedge at its waist; a curved stem down to a second bowtie-and-foot cross."
